WEBVTT

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:00.260
were consulted to come up with software

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:05.710
that could rectify its own various faults.

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:11.480
The task that seemed impossible
initially was nearing its completion now.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:15.880
The software was created 
in a record-breaking 10 months.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:19.600
(Applause)

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:22.950
To fulfil such a demanding target,

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:26.980
hundreds of scientists 
worked together tirelessly.

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:29.670
This is ISRO’s team spirit.

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:34.520
Our next challenge 
was to find such a path